# Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth: "Each land is a Swamp in addition to its other land types." Both players' lands gain
# Swamp, keeping their other land types and their names, and Urborg itself is a Swamp too (CR 305.7, 613.1d).

[Bot1 Deck]
Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth
Plains
Plains x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Forest x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth.Subtypes = Swamp
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Subtypes = Plains; Swamp
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Types = Land
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Subtypes = Forest; Swamp
